ch("c34",2,"W","Why don't you join us for the hike this weekend?","I'd love to. What time are you leaving?",["Because I joined the club last year.","The hike is about ten kilometers.","I don't know why they left."],"Why don't you …? = Einladung, keine Frage nach dem Grund.")
