ch("c36",2,"W","Is it okay if I bring a friend to the study group?","Sure, the more the merrier.",["I studied with friends in high school.","The group meets in the library.","Okay, I'll bring the books."],"the more the merrier = je mehr, desto besser (Zustimmung).")
ch("c37",2,"M","Didn't the professor say the exam would be open-book?","Only for the second part, I think.",["I opened the book this morning.","The exam room is closed.","She's a very good professor."],"Präzisierende Antwort auf eine Rückfrage.")
ch("c38",2,"W","You look exhausted. Late night?","Yeah, I was up finishing my report.",["No, I'm not late at all.","It gets dark early these days.","I'll be there tonight."],"Late night? = Lange aufgeblieben? → Bestätigung mit Grund.")
ch("c39",3,"M","I was under the impression the deadline had been pushed back.","It was, but only for the graduate students.",["I pushed the door, but it was locked.","The impression was very positive.","The deadline is printed on the back."],"under the impression = dachte; pushed back = verschoben.")
ch("c40",3,"W","You wouldn't happen to have a spare charger, would you?","I might. What kind of phone do you have?",["I happened to see him yesterday.","No, I don't charge for that.","My phone is fully charged."],"Sehr höfliche, indirekte Bitte → Gegenfrage, um helfen zu können.")
ch("c41",3,"M","If I were you, I'd ask for an extension.","I might, but I'd hate to fall even further behind.",["Yes, you were right about the extension cord.","I asked him yesterday where you were.","The extension is on the second floor."],"Ratschlag → abwägende Reaktion; die anderen spielen mit „extension“.")
